# Code owners for this repository on GitHub.
#
# There are two CODEOWNERS files here and that is deliberate. GitHub looks in
# .github/, then the repository root, then docs/, and uses the first one it
# finds — so this file is the one GitHub applies and the root CODEOWNERS is not.
# The root file names these same three people by their gitcode.com logins, for
# the mirror's own review UI. The handles are not interchangeable: a GitHub
# login means nothing there, and a GitCode login requests review from nobody
# here. Change one and consider whether the other needs the same change.
#
# Syntax is gitignore's, with no negation and no character ranges. Rules apply
# top to bottom and the last matching one wins, so a narrower rule added later
# belongs below this one, not above it.
#
# An owner is only requested for review while they have write access to this
# repository; GitHub silently ignores an entry for anyone who does not.

